Subject: [PATCH 01/28] biometrics: expose opt-in UDFPS lifecycle notifications
 for devices

Keep vendor protocols in device services. Report actual overlay attachment/removal, fingerprint request lifetimes, lockout, controller/HAL death and display fade state without making OEM calls on framework threads. Preserve existing SystemUI notification timing unless explicitly enabled by an overlay.

